  "details": "1. Open VRChat\n\n2. Go to a world with a focussed canvas\n\n3. Focus on canvas\n\n4. Delete canvas while focussed\n\nIf a player focuses on a menu in IOS and the menu is disabled or deleted (unsure which one) the player is locked in the focus view. Exit focus button does not work. Persists between worlds. This is most easily replicable in Crazium’s specter spectare.",
